{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20263xKPVXItzE1792833837.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>行政長官李家超祝賀本港運動員在亞殘運會奪得佳績。</p><p></p><p>港隊在今屆亞殘運會共取得3金、14銀、24銅，李家超形容運動員表現優秀，更特別表揚硬地滾球項目，共取2金、3銀、3銅的歷屆最佳成績。李家超指，運動員在賽場上拼博，展現精湛技術及頑強鬥志，向社會傳遞堅毅不屈、永不言敗的體育精神，令市民敬佩及自豪。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CE.OS-1630_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026xcVK4ZI4a71792833908.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>文體旅局局長羅淑佩就指，衷心感謝所有運動員的全力付出，為市民帶來感動與驕傲。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T10:03:06.105506+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":186,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T09:08:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T18:37:59.300542+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T09:58:18.410536+00:00","content_hash":"9521d4e21b05c28951a13e171d154920bbb7f6496e7d9e2b89be80dd4f1c639f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-24T10:03:06.105506+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}